 "remarks": "Unique and Charming cottage on large, historic West Norwalk property is a private sanctuary while only 2.5 miles to downtown New Canaan and minutes from Target, Wegmans, Costco and the Darien Trader Joes. Spacious eat in kitchen with dishwasher and private in unit laundry. Window unit for air conditioning included. Plenty of outdoor space for your use. 2 bedrooms and 2 baths (with clawfoot tubs!), hardwood floors and a beautiful covered deck overlooking the property. Plenty of FREE off street parking. How much are you paying for utilities these days? Well not here: Electricity, Heat and Hot water included in the base rental ( a $300/month savings!). No additional fee for pets!",
